{
 "title": "War",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "War",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c221",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Six months later, the whole country was coming",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c222",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "apart.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c223",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "January 11th, 1861.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c224",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Alabama votes to leave the United States.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c225",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And now, our street.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c226",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "February 1861.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c227",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Delegates from the seceding states gather in Montgomery.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c228",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They found a new country.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c229",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The Confederate States of America.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c230",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And Montgomery is its first capital.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c231",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "On February 18th, at the top of the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c232",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "five blocks on the steps of the Capitol,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c233",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Jefferson Davis is sworn in as President of",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c234",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the Confederacy.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c235",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A bronze star still marks the spot.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c236",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then, April 11th.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c237",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In an office building at the bottom of",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c238",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "that same street, right on Court Square, a",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c239",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "telegram is sent to Charleston.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c240",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It authorizes the attack on a fort called",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c241",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Sumter.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c242",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The next morning, the guns fire.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c243",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The Civil War has begun.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c244",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And the order to start it went out",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c245",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "from the same five blocks where human beings",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c246",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "were sold.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c247",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Montgomery stayed the capital for about three months.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c248",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then the Confederacy moved to Richmond, Virginia.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c249",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And the war moved away with it.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c250",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "For a while, Alabama felt far from the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c251",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "fighting.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c252",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Its men did not.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c253",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "At sea, a Confederate raider named the CSS",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c254",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Alabama hunted Union merchant ships across the world's",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c255",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "oceans, until it was sunk off the coast",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c256",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "of France.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c257",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "August 1864.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c258",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Union warships forced their way into Mobile Bay",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c259",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "through a field of underwater mines, which back",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c260",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "then were called torpedoes.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c261",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The story goes that Admiral Farragut shouted, damn",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c262",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the torpedoes, full speed ahead.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c263",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Whether he said it or not, he won",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c264",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the bay.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c265",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And in the spring of 1865, Union cavalry",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c266",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "swept across Alabama.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c267",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They burned ironworks and arsenals.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c268",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They burned most of the University of Alabama.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c269",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Spring 1865, the war ends, and 435,000",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c270",
     "shot": "todo_war",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "people in Alabama are free.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}